        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "zpmVT",
          "name": "Brief",
          "width": 820,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "l1Zzi",
              "name": "标题",
              "fill": "#111111",
              "content": "CastGlean UI 组件方案选型",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": "bold"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "dTwL1",
              "name": "目标",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "为 Tauri 2 桌面端选一个组件基础方案，先定框架，再统一现有设计稿。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wIRbE",
              "name": "已定约束",
              "fill": "#555555",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "已定：React 19 · TypeScript · Vite · Tailwind CSS v4 · TanStack Router · Lingui i18n · Tauri 2 Rust 宿主持有全部状态。界面形态：正文阅读区 + 检查面板 + 播放器/波形 + 后台任务流，密集型桌面工作台。设计稿方向：深色 + 橙色点缀。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "k0PQQD",
              "name": "选型关注点",
              "fill": "#555555",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "关注点：① React 19 兼容 ② 与 Tailwind v4 的关系 ③ 深色主题实现方式 ④ 头无/成品组件对自绘组件（波形、虚拟化正文）的配合 ⑤ 文案是否可完全交给 Lingui ⑥ 长期升级方式（源码持有 vs 依赖库）",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "browser",
          "id": "mE9mc",
